WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.528
Welcome to Tarafab.XAi, where market insights meet intelligent automation.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.079
Your dashboard brings your balances, recent activity,

3
00:00:09.079 --> 00:00:14.192
and available investment products together, so you can review your account in one place.

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.329
Browse the investment products, and open one to review its limits,

5
00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:21.444
duration, fees, and stated terms.

6
00:00:21.444 --> 00:00:23.879
Confirm only when you understand them.

7
00:00:23.879 --> 00:00:28.621
Projected terms and profits actually credited are always shown separately,

8
00:00:28.621 --> 00:00:32.209
and you can follow every investment from your dashboard.

9
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.589
The XAI Automation Engine monitors your selected markets,

10
00:00:36.589 --> 00:00:39.980
and evaluates the rules you configure every minute.

11
00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.173
Each check and alert is recorded,

12
00:00:42.173 --> 00:00:45.630
so you can follow market activity and stay informed.

13
00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.159
It monitors and alerts.

14
00:00:47.159 --> 00:00:48.821
It does not place trades.

15
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.994
Explore investment opportunities, follow market activity,

16
00:00:52.994 --> 00:00:56.430
and stay informed throughout your investment journey.

17
00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:59.476
Understand the risks, and discover Tarafab.XAi.

